  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Resilient Agriculture in Somalia (Ugbaad)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will promote a shift to, and scale-up of the sustainable landscape management approach and climate resilient agriculture to increase resilience to climate change and its extreme events that affect agriculture and other livelihoods by repairing degraded ecosystems and irrigation infrastructure, improving agriculture and livestock sectors, and enhancing access to climate information services.</narrative>
  </description>
